<body>
<main class="wrap">
<nav class="histnav" id="histNav" hidden>
  <button type="button" class="btn nav" id="navBack">◀ 지난 화면 보기</button>
</nav>
<div id="reviewView" hidden>
  <div class="rv-bar">
    <p class="rv-tag" id="rvTag"></p>
    <div class="rv-btns">
      <button type="button" class="btn nav" id="rvPrev">◀ 이전</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn nav" id="rvNext">다음 ▶</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn primary nav" id="rvLive">지금 화면으로</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="review" id="rvBody"></div>
</div>
<div id="createView">
  <header>
    <h1>신무장 생성</h1>
    <button type="button" class="btn nav rank-open" id="rankBtn">🏆 랭킹 보기</button>
    <p class="lede">삼국지 일기토 시뮬레이터. 성별과 이름을 정하고, 주사위로 통솔·무력·지력을 정한 뒤, 개성과 사상을 고릅니다.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="block" aria-label="성별" id="genderSec" style="margin-top:0">
    <fieldset class="group">
      <legend>성별</legend>
      <div class="gender-opts" id="genderOpts"></div>
    </fieldset>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-label="이름" id="nameSec" style="margin-top:0">
    <fieldset class="group">
      <legend>이름</legend>
      <div class="name-row">
        <label class="fld"><span>이름</span>
          <input id="nameIn" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" enterkeyhint="next" placeholder="예: 관우">
          <small class="cnt" id="nameCnt">0 / 4</small></label>
        <label class="fld"><span>자(字) <em>선택</em></span>
          <input id="styleIn" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" enterkeyhint="done" placeholder="예: 운장">
          <small class="cnt" id="styleCnt">0 / 4</small></label>
      </div>
      <p class="fld-hint">이름과 자는 각각 최대 4글자(8바이트)입니다. 한글, 한자, 영문, 숫자를 쓸 수 있어요.</p>
      <p class="fld-hint" id="nameDefault"></p>
      <p class="fld-err" id="nameErr" role="alert" hidden></p>
    </fieldset>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="능력치">
    <div class="slips" id="slips">
      <div class="slip"><span class="gauge"><i></i></span><div class="slip-name"><b><span>統</span><span>率</span></b><small>통솔</small></div><output class="slip-num">?</output></div>
      <div class="slip"><span class="gauge"><i></i></span><div class="slip-name"><b><span>武</span><span>力</span></b><small>무력</small></div><output class="slip-num">?</output></div>
      <div class="slip"><span class="gauge"><i></i></span><div class="slip-name"><b><span>智</span><span>力</span></b><small>지력</small></div><output class="slip-num">?</output></div>
    </div>

    <div class="meter" id="meter">
      <div class="meter-row">
        <div class="meter-total"><span>합계 </span><b id="total">—</b><span> / 160</span></div>
        <div class="meter-msg" id="meterMsg">주사위를 굴려 능력치를 정하세요.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="track" aria-hidden="true"><i id="bar"></i></div>
    </div>

    <div class="rollrow">
      <button class="btn primary big" id="roll" type="button">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="3.5"/>
          <circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          <circle cx="15.5" cy="8.5" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          <circle cx="8.5" cy="15.5" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          <circle cx="15.5" cy="15.5" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
        </svg>
        <span id="rollLabel">주사위 굴리기</span>
      </button>
      <span class="count" id="count">굴린 횟수 0</span>
    </div>
    <p class="sr" id="live" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="histSec" hidden>
    <h2>굴린 기록</h2>
    <p class="hint">기록을 누르면 그 결과로 되돌릴 수 있어요. 마음에 드는 결과는 언제든 다시 고를 수 있습니다.</p>
    <ul class="hist" id="hist"></ul>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-label="선택 항목" id="choices"></section>

  <section class="make">
    <button class="btn primary" id="make" type="button" disabled>신무장 생성</button>
    <p id="makeHint"></p>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet" id="sheet" hidden aria-live="polite"></section>
</div>

<div id="trainView" hidden>
  <header>
    <h1>육성</h1>
    <p class="lede" id="trLede"></p>
  </header>
  <div class="tr-me" id="trMe"></div>
  <div class="sheet-stats" id="trStats"></div>
  <p class="tr-ops" id="trOps"></p>
  <p class="tr-ops" id="trItem" hidden></p>
  <p class="tr-gold" id="trGold"></p>
  <section class="block" id="trAct" aria-label="행동 선택"></section>
  <label class="skip-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="skipCard"> <span>결과 카드 건너뛰기 <small>(기록에만 남기고 바로 진행)</small></span></label>
  <section class="tr-log" id="trLog" aria-live="polite"></section>
  <div class="make" id="trNext"></div>
</div>
<div id="marketView" hidden>
  <header>
    <h1>시장</h1>
    <p class="lede" id="mkLede"></p>
  </header>
  <div class="mk-hero" role="img" aria-label="장터 거리"><div class="mk-gold" id="mkGold"></div></div>
  <div class="mk-tabs" id="mkTabs" role="tablist" aria-label="시장 분류"></div>
  <section class="mk-block" id="mkSlots" aria-label="내 슬롯"></section>
  <section class="mk-block" id="mkList" aria-label="판매 목록"></section>
  <div class="make" id="mkNext"></div>
</div>
<div id="tourView" hidden>
  <header>
    <h1 id="tvTitle">일기토 대회</h1>
    <p class="lede" id="tvLede"></p>
  </header>
  <section id="tvMain" aria-live="polite"></section>
